{
  "id": "b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Social media and friendship",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you like most about the area where you live?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you usually keep in touch with your friends?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think it is easy to make new friends nowadays?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how much time do you think is reasonable to spend on social media every day?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e02-a1",
            "b2-e02-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people using their phones. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think using a phone is a good way to spend free time? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e02-b1",
            "b2-e02-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people enjoying a performance or a day out. Compare the photographs, and say why these people might have chosen to spend their time this way.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, which of these would you prefer to do? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can affect friendships, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might social media change the way people make and keep friends?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which has the biggest effect on friendship?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about social media.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that online friends are not real friends. What is your opinion?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think social media makes it harder to be alone with our thoughts?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how can people protect themselves from unkind comments online?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should there be an age limit for using social media?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, will the way we talk to our friends be very different in twenty years?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e02-social-media-and-friendship/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
